  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto recently observed the official destruction of 601.7 tons of confiscated narcotics, a significant operation carried out by the Indonesian National Police. The event, which also included the unveiling of various digital fraud prevention measures, was attended by senior government officials, including the Minister of Home Affairs, Tito Karnavian. In his address, the President emphasized the essential duties of the national police force and expressed support for their performance in curbing illicit drug activities across the country. Lawmakers have publicly praised the police for this action, calling for continued efforts to target major drug distributors and dismantle international trafficking rings at their source. Additionally, the police have initiated programs such as 'Poliran' to support the recovery and empowerment of drug users as part of a broader strategy against substance abuse.",
